title State Diagram — Inventory Reservation
hide empty description
[*] -down-> AVAILABLE
AVAILABLE -down-> RESERVED : reserve()\n[available >= qty]\n/ available-1, reserved+1
RESERVED -down-> PAYMENT_PENDING : startPayment()\n[expires_at > now]
RESERVED -down-> TIMEOUT : sweeper\n[expires_at passed]
PAYMENT_PENDING -up-> RESERVED : PSP circuit open\n(customer may retry)
PAYMENT_PENDING -down-> CONFIRMED : PaymentSucceeded\n/ reserved-1, sold+1
PAYMENT_PENDING -right-> PAYMENT_FAILED : PaymentFailed
CONFIRMED -down-> SOLD : OrderConfirmed
PAYMENT_FAILED -down-> RELEASED : / reserved-1, available+1,\ngate token+1
TIMEOUT -down-> RELEASED : / reserved-1, available+1,\ngate token+1
SOLD -down-> [*]
RELEASED -down-> [*]
note left of PAYMENT_PENDING
  The expiry sweeper NEVER expires
  PAYMENT_PENDING: money may be moving.
  The payment reconciler owns it.
end note

@enduml
